        "app_name": "Motion Soccer",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "**Motion Soccer** offers you a virtual reality football experience with realistic 11v11 matches that immerse you in the heart of the beautiful game. With three versatile game modes and the ability to switch between them mid-match, you’ll have full control over how you experience football.\n\n1. **Tactical Mode**: Use **mixed reality** to place a football field in your real space. Become the strategist by choosing tactics and formations, or control players from a real-time aerial view.\n\n2. **First-Person Mode with Classic Controls**: Play in first-person using traditional joystick and button controls. Ideal for playing seated, you'll feel the thrill of every move from the player’s perspective.\n\n3. **First-Person Mode with Expert Controls**: Control players’ feet with motion controllers. Though it requires practice, mastering this mode will allow you to make creative and unique plays.\n\nCompete in **exciting tournaments** that will test your tactical and gameplay skills. Customize your teams and strategies to prove you're the best on the field. While we don’t have official licenses, we’ve created teams inspired by the best clubs and national teams in the world, offering an authentic experience.\n\n**Motion Soccer** is not just a game, it’s a **new way to experience football in virtual reality**. Are you ready to redefine how football is played?\n",
